  "source": "Unseeded fastrand tie-break and softmax draw in the default picker (lib/router-plugins/builtin/src/default/picker.rs:106,118; builtin no-YAML default uses the same unseeded path). Random UUID v4 request ids do not change simulated outcomes (round_robin, lmetric, two-tier, seeded default give identical per-request rows across runs); they only reorder per_request records, so native summary means and stds differ at float-summation level (~1e-15 relative). Counts and goodput are identical.",
  "tie_noise_example": "Same N=8 cell, default cost fn: unseeded runs gave goodput 2.8832/2.8910 (builtin) and 2.8934/2.8290 (catalog); seeds 1 and 2 gave 2.8687 and 2.8180. Use several seeds (common random numbers) to measure tie noise.",
